## المرحلة 0: تثبيت الأساس

### P0.1 نجاح البناء والاختبارات

```text
Feature: Make the current repo build and pass tests on Codemagic.
Goal: A green "KroGram - Build & Test" workflow.
Attached: codemagic.yaml, KroGram/project.yml, the build log, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.
Requirements:
- Find every compile error from the log and fix it with minimal changes.
- Check that XcodeGen config includes all source and test folders.
- Do not add features.
Done when: build + tests would pass; list any remaining risk.
```

### P0.2 إغلاق مسودة Phase A

```text
Feature: Finish the unverified Phase A items.
Goal: Make text formatting, remote search, reactions, pin/forward, incoming polls, and voice messages correct against TDLib.
Attached: the files for chat, composer, media, and polls; docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.
Requirements:
- Audit each item against td_api.tl and fix wrong calls.
- Voice notes: record AAC in M4A, then check TDLib's expected format for inputMessageVoiceNote (waveform, duration). Explain whether conversion to OGG/Opus is required and implement it if so.
- Polls: vote, retract vote, show results.
- Add unit tests for the pure logic parts.
Done when: each item has a manual test steps list I can run on a device.
```

### P0.3 جاهزية المستودع

```text
Feature: Repository hygiene.
Goal: Safe, clear repo.
Requirements:
- Add a LICENSE file (I will tell you which license) and a THIRD_PARTY notice for TDLib (Boost) and any other dependency.
- Update .gitignore for Xcode, signing files, and secrets.
- Add a README section stating this is an unofficial client that uses the user's own api_id/api_hash.
Done when: files are ready to commit.
```

